    {
      "title": "Principal Shareholders",
      "excerpt": "Principal Shareholders \u201d), and Wenfang Song, an individual, solely in his capacity as the shareholder representative,\nagent and attorney-in-fact of the Principal Shareholder. The aggregate consideration for the Acquisition Merger (the \u201c Merger\nConsideration \u201d) is $1,000,000,000, payable to the Isdera Group Shareholders in the form of newly issued PubCo Ordinary Shares\n(as defined below) valued at $10.00 per share. The calculation of the Merger Consideration would result in the aggregate issuance to the\nIsdera Group Shareholders at the Closing (as defined below), of 100,000,000 PubCo Ordinary Shares (the \u201c Closing Payment Shares \u201d). Upon the Closing of the Business\nCombination, ordinary shares of PubCo will be comprised into class\u00a0A ordinary shares of a par value of US$0.0001 each (\u201c PubCo\nClass\u00a0A Ordinary Shares \u201d) and class\u00a0B ordinary shares of a par value of US$0.0001 each (\u201c PubCo Cla",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
